fullDescription:
Dice Thrower is a game-agnostic dice companion for tabletop and role-playing games.

Create lightweight characters with a name, optional image and free-form game tag. Attach reusable dice rolls such as 1d20+8, 6d6+6 or 4d3+3d6+10, organize them into groups, and arrange the dashboard to match how you play.

Main features:
• configurable characters and quick-roll dashboards;
• grouped and ungrouped rolls with custom ordering;
• d2, d3, d4, d6, d10, d12, d20 and d100;
• composite expressions with modifiers;
• roll by shaking the phone or using a configurable button;
• local roll history with configurable retention;
• light and dark themes;
• multilingual interface.

Dice Thrower is designed to work offline. It requires no account, contains no advertising or analytics, and keeps character data, settings and roll history on the device.
